      ],
      "orig": "M.Sc. AI & ML student at TUDarmstadt with 3.5 years of professional experience in Business Analytics across FinTech and Travel industries. Currently focussed on hands-on implementation of modern agentic AI systems , especially the SLMs, with reduction in hallucination . Experience across the ML stack - from data analysis & preprocessing, to probabilistic model training, to on-device LLMs. I am eager to apply this blend of business acumen and technical research to build scalable and reliable ML solutions.",
      "text": "M.Sc. AI & ML student at TUDarmstadt with 3.5 years of professional experience in Business Analytics across FinTech and Travel industries. Currently focussed on hands-on implementation of modern agentic AI systems , especially the SLMs, with reduction in hallucination . Experience across the ML stack - from data analysis & preprocessing, to probabilistic model training, to on-device LLMs. I am eager to apply this blend of business acumen and technical research to build scalable and reliable ML solutions."
    },
