      "orig": "\u00b7 Architected an on-device , React-native app that combines LLMs with a Dynamic Bayesian Network (DBN) resulting in a Causal Inference and Explainable AI (XAI) framework, which structurally prevents hallucinations .",
      "text": "Architected an on-device , React-native app that combines LLMs with a Dynamic Bayesian Network (DBN) resulting in a Causal Inference and Explainable AI (XAI) framework, which structurally prevents hallucinations .",
      "enumerated": false,
      "marker": "\u00b7"
    },
